    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67671" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῐγάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ</span> and ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mixed pell-mell</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιγάσιν Ἕλλησιν βαρβάροις θ᾽ ὁμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1356
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ πολλῶν ἐθνῶν μιγάδες συλλεγέντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.24
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοὶ δ᾽ ἔπιπτον μιγάδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					1142
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θρήϊξιν μιγάδες Σκύθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.320
				</span></i>
			: as fem., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. λοιβαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.1210
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιξοβάρβαρος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				53.6
			</span></i>.</div>
